<div class="login-overlay show dev-console-login" id="loginOverlay">
  <!-- Shown by default while initAuth() figures out whether a session
       can be restored — without this, that brief detection window
       (see ensureStorageBackendDetected) looked exactly like data had
       been wiped: the login form would flash up, then your session
       and data would suddenly reappear a moment later. This panel
       just labels that wait honestly instead of implying you're logged
       out. Hidden by hideSessionCheckingUI(), called from showLogin()
       and logout() once the real answer is known. -->
