/* ============================== PHASE 2 ==============================
   Device Fingerprint & Hardware ID Generator — source: erp_device_fingerprint.js (unmodified)
   ======================================================================= */
/* =========================================================================
   ERP DEVICE FINGERPRINTING & BINDING MODULE — Phase 2
   =========================================================================
   Self-contained. No external libraries. Pairs with the Phase 1 crypto
   module (ERPCrypto) — generateFingerprint() below uses ERPCrypto.generateHash
